// Type-checking contract: includeLabelIndexes must be a BOOL. Passing
// an integer (or any non-boolean) must throw runtime_error at parse time
// with the message "Configuration value for 'includeLabelIndexes' must be
// a boolean". Protects against user typos and silent acceptance of wrong
// types that would otherwise default to truthy (e.g. a naive C++ cast).
CALL graph_project('bad_int', 'User', 'KNOWS', {includeLabelIndexes: 1})
YIELD graphName
RETURN graphName
